		<div class="topic" id="forum_op_topic_583935635494110426">
		To what extent does Aion 2 utilize AI?	</div>
	<div class="content" id="forum_op_content_583935635494110426">
		I was considering dipping my toes in, however I was a bit curious what exactly is AI in the game itself and how much of it is derived from such. Are we talking in terms of music composition, translation/localization, 3D asset generation, writing, 2D icons and/or something else like AI concept art in preproduction? <br><br>Thanks so much	</div>
		
	<div class="forum_op_footer">
		<div></div>
			</div>
</div>
<div data-featuretarget="community-awards"></div>
<script type="text/javascript">
	$J( function() {
		InitializeForumTopic( {"owner":"46074831","type":"General","feature":"1","gidforum":"807973945275927412","forum_display_name":"General Discussion","forum_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/3393110\/discussions\/1\/","forum_search_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/3393110\/discussions\/search\/","is_public":1,"permissions":{"can_view":1,"can_post":1,"can_reply":1,"is_banned":0,"can_delete":0,"can_edit":0},"appid":3393110}, "https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/forum\/46074831\/General\/",
		"583935635494110426", {"author":"nickviguenewhaven","text":"I was considering dipping my toes in, however I was a bit curious what exactly is AI in the game itself and how much of it is derived from such. Are we talking in terms of music composition, translation\/localization, 3D asset generation, writing, 2D icons and\/or something else like AI concept art in preproduction? \n\nThanks so much"}		);
			} );
</script>
										<script type="text/javascript">
$J( function() { InitializeCommentThread( "ForumTopic", "ForumTopic_103582791475596239_807973945275927412_583935635494110426", {"feature":"807973945275927412","feature2":"583935635494110426","owner":"103582791475596239","commentthreadid":"656650793","total_count":23,"start":0,"pagesize":15,"has_upvoted":0,"upvotes":0,"votecountid":null,"voteupid":null,"commentcountid":null,"subscribed":false,"extended_data":"{\"topic_permissions\":{\"can_view\":1,\"can_post\":1,\"can_reply\":1,\"is_banned\":0,\"can_delete\":0,\"can_edit\":0},\"original_poster\":968650913,\"topic_gidanswer\":\"0\",\"forum_appid\":3393110,\"forum_public\":1,\"forum_type\":\"General\",\"forum_gidfeature\":\"1\"}","oldestfirst":true,"comments_raw":{"583935635494111559":{"text":"The entire game was made in chatgpt.","author":"DJ Gershwin"},"583935635494111793":{"text":"Meanwhile real humans unable to recreate the magic in mmorpgs that happened 20-25 years ago.  But its popular to hate AI so people do.  Only chance we have getting a good mmorpg will be due to AI and lack of investors.  ","author":"CyberDown"},"583935635494114463":{"text":"We answered this recently in this thread:\nhttps:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/3393110\/discussions\/1\/583935003344372119\/\n\nHello everyone,\n\nWe\u2019ve followed the discussion here about the use of AI in game development and wanted to clarify how our artwork is created.\n\nAION 2 is built by a large, incredibly talented team with hundreds of artists who painstakingly create the characters, environments, animations, and visual identity of Atreia by hand. The overwhelming majority of the art you will experience in the game is a result of their craft and countless hours of work. \n\nWe are proud of what we\u2019ve made and hope our passion comes through as you play the game for the first time over the coming week. Our disclaimer on our store page was made out of an abundance of caution. 99.9% of the art in the game is made by humans and any use of AI is replaced by our handcrafted finished graphics.\n\nThanks for reading and for your enthusiasm about our game!","author":"[NC] CM Sakaar"},"583935635494115357":{"text":"[quote=NC CM Sakaar;583935635494114463]We answered this recently in this thread:\nhttps:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/3393110\/discussions\/1\/583935003344372119\/\n\nHello everyone,\n\nWe\u2019ve followed the discussion here about the use of AI in game development and wanted to clarify how our artwork is created.\n\nAION 2 is built by a large, incredibly talented team with hundreds of artists who painstakingly create the characters, environments, animations, and visual identity of Atreia by hand. The overwhelming majority of the art you will experience in the game is a result of their craft and countless hours of work. \n\nWe are proud of what we\u2019ve made and hope our passion comes through as you play the game for the first time over the coming week. Our disclaimer on our store page was made out of an abundance of caution. 99.9% of the art in the game is made by humans and any use of AI is replaced by our handcrafted finished graphics.\n\nThanks for reading and for your enthusiasm about our game! [\/quote]\n\nWhat about outfits etc... Are any of those generated by ai?\nOr only icons and cards?","author":"\u239b\u239d Kupo \u23a0\u239e"},"583935635494115575":{"text":"[quote=CyberDown;583935635494111793]Meanwhile real humans unable to recreate the magic in mmorpgs that happened 20-25 years ago.  But its popular to hate AI so people do.  Only chance we have getting a good mmorpg will be due to AI and lack of investors. [\/quote]\n\nThe reason they'll never be able to do that is because you're not 14 anymore, no MMO is ever going to recreate it.\nYou can't recreate your first time.\n\n There's good reasons to hate generative ai... It's built on theft and parasites off of artists the same people who make these games...\nIt's just bizarre to defend it, because you're not defending creatives you're defending corporate who want to replace people to save a buck.\nThe people who actually make the games pretty much universally don't want to use this shit and are forced to.\n\n It's strange how some people defend gen ai being used so hard when all that is happening is you're being given a lower quality product so a CEO can buy another yacht.","author":"\u239b\u239d Kupo \u23a0\u239e"},"583935635494116189":{"text":"[quote=\u239b\u239d Kupo \u23a0\u239e;583935635494115575][quote=CyberDown;583935635494111793]Meanwhile real humans unable to recreate the magic in mmorpgs that happened 20-25 years ago.  But its popular to hate AI so people do.  Only chance we have getting a good mmorpg will be due to AI and lack of investors. [\/quote]\n\nThe reason they'll never be able to do that is because you're not 14 anymore, no MMO is ever going to recreate it.\nYou can't recreate your first time.\n\n There's good reasons to hate generative ai... It's built on theft and parasites off of artists the same people who make these games...\nIt's just bizarre to defend it, because you're not defending creatives you're defending corporate who want to replace people to save a buck.\nThe people who actually make the games pretty much universally don't want to use this shit and are forced to.\n\n It's strange how some people defend gen ai being used so hard when all that is happening is you're being given a lower quality product so a CEO can buy another yacht. [\/quote]\nAi bot post ignore","author":"DJ Gershwin"},"583935635494172733":{"text":"[quote=DJ Gershwin;583935635494111559]The entire game was made in chatgpt. [\/quote]\nWait, was it really? This makes me so sad if that's true.","author":"Ale"},"583935635494176390":{"text":"[quote=Ale;583935635494172733][quote=DJ Gershwin;583935635494111559]The entire game was made in chatgpt. [\/quote]\nWait, was it really? This makes me so sad if that's true. [\/quote]\nThere would be more noises if that was true but you never know. Dialogues are apparently spicy enough to have that thought. Cinematics are AI it seems.","author":"Firecam"},"583936001036090060":{"text":"[quote=Ale;583935635494172733][quote=DJ Gershwin;583935635494111559]The entire game was made in chatgpt. [\/quote]\nWait, was it really? This makes me so sad if that's true. [\/quote]\n\nAs of yet, its impossible to prompt chatgpt to make aion2. You can only generate pieces of a game and use coding agents to piece them together. So for now at least a dozent of people were involved in making of aion \u02d0compa\u02d0","author":"Hifumi Starlight"},"583936001036091278":{"text":"[quote=CyberDown;583935635494111793]Meanwhile real humans unable to recreate the magic in mmorpgs that happened 20-25 years ago.  But its popular to hate AI so people do.  Only chance we have getting a good mmorpg will be due to AI and lack of investors. [\/quote]\n\nMmorpgs aren't that different from those years back then. What has changed is the world itself. Mmos used to be what social media is to us today. Internet is normalized, people we interact with are just names instead of actual people behind them. You have people cussing or starting fights over nothing. Socializing with people across the world is normalized, there is no more \"magic\" in that. Newer generations are super competitive and achievement focused so they rush content like bunch of druggies ignoring online aspect of socialization in mmos.\n\nWe got to enjoy best years of mmorpgs xD it's over old man","author":"Crylz"},"583936001036091409":{"text":"[quote=Ale;583935635494172733][quote=DJ Gershwin;583935635494111559]The entire game was made in chatgpt. [\/quote]\nWait, was it really? This makes me so sad if that's true. [\/quote]\nIts just insane you even believe that...","author":"Caduryn"},"583936001036110325":{"text":"[quote=Caduryn;583936001036091409][quote=Ale;583935635494172733]\nWait, was it really? This makes me so sad if that's true. [\/quote]\nIts just insane you even believe that... [\/quote]\nit was actually claude code","author":"DJ Gershwin"},"583936001036119927":{"text":"[quote=CyberDown;583935635494111793]Meanwhile real humans unable to recreate the magic in mmorpgs that happened 20-25 years ago.  But its popular to hate AI so people do.  Only chance we have getting a good mmorpg will be due to AI and lack of investors. [\/quote]\n\nThat's because the only ones motivated by that are frauds who just want to put out a playable version and then sell it as early access and run off with all the money. It happens all the time and triple A studios don't care about that, it's infinitely more profitable to release some mobile game with whales. \n\nThose games earns billions per year just from microtransactions alone, FF14 really is the only one left that's a proper MMO and not ruined by all this.\n\nI have plans and I know there's a vet dev team out there working on something too but it's all too early to even mention anything.","author":"FugNugt"},"583936001036122528":{"text":"[quote=NC CM Sakaar;583935635494114463]We answered this recently in this thread:\nhttps:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/3393110\/discussions\/1\/583935003344372119\/\n[\/quote]\n\nSome people are deaf and blind.\nThey think they are intelligent, and for some reason, are trying to compete with Ai...\n\nBut thank you for clearing that up for everyone that can understand basic English.\n\nAi is the devil to so many people - not because they care about humanity, creativity, or even Armageddon...\n\nBut because it shows them up.  \nFrom chat bots, to music, to art, to video gen...  Ai is a tool.  \nAnd used responsibly, is an asset.\n\nBut people are too often the problem.  And technology always gets scape-goated.\n\nTurning the world into a bunch of angry Villagers, trying to burn Frankenstein's monster - again...\nUtterly blind to the fact ethics and integrity are human concepts.\n\nSome of us appreciate the work that was put in, regardless.  \nThanks again.","author":"Darque"},"583936001036127688":{"text":"Best use of AI would be for taking out Bots RMT and the cause of the rot the Gold Buyers.","author":"Wompoo"}},"track_navigation":true}, 'https://steamcommunity.com/comment/ForumTopic/', 40 ); } );
</script>
