				<div class="commentthread_comment_actions" >
														<a class="forum_comment_action forum_comment_action_trigger" data-tooltip-type="selector" data-tooltip-content="#forum_comment_actions_menu_583935635494114463">
					<span><i class="ico16 arrow_down"></i></span>
				</a>
			
			<div class="forum_comment_action_menu" style="display: none;" id="forum_comment_actions_menu_583935635494114463">				<a class="forum_comment_action report tooltip" href="javascript:Forum_ShowReportDialog( '103582791475596239', '807973945275927412', '583935635494110426', '685387108', '583935635494114463' );" data-tooltip-text="Denunciar este mensaje por contenido inapropiado. Los mensajes denunciados son marcados para que sean revisados por los moderadores.">
				<span class="non_breaking_space">&nbsp;</span><img src="https://community.fastly.steamstatic.com/public/images/skin_1/notification_icon_flag_dark.png?v=1">Denunciar este mensaje</a>
			</div>
							</div>
			</div>
			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_583935635494114463">
				We answered this recently in this thread:<br><a class="bb_link" href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/3393110/discussions/1/583935003344372119/" target="_blank" rel="" >https://steamcommunity.com/app/3393110/discussions/1/583935003344372119/</a><br><br>Hello everyone,<br><br>We’ve followed the discussion here about the use of AI in game development and wanted to clarify how our artwork is created.<br><br>AION 2 is built by a large, incredibly talented team with hundreds of artists who painstakingly create the characters, environments, animations, and visual identity of Atreia by hand. The overwhelming majority of the art you will experience in the game is a result of their craft and countless hours of work. <br><br>We are proud of what we’ve made and hope our passion comes through as you play the game for the first time over the coming week. Our disclaimer on our store page was made out of an abundance of caution. 99.9% of the art in the game is made by humans and any use of AI is replaced by our handcrafted finished graphics.<br><br>Thanks for reading and for your enthusiasm about our game!			</div>
			<div class="comment_footer_ctn">
									<div></div>
				
				
									<div class="forum_comment_permlink">
						<span class="forum_comment_moderate">
													</span>
